{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"elementType","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS7Elementxmfp"},{"text":".Type = Element.self, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferingPolicy","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"limit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/Continuation","text":"Continuation","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferingPolicy","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/Continuation\/BufferingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"text":" = .unbounded, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"build","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","text":"Continuation","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/Continuation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"elementType","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The type of element the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"type":"text","text":" produces."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"limit","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Continuation.BufferingPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" value to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the stream’s buffering behavior. By default, the stream buffers an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unlimited number of elements. You can also set the policy to buffer a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified number of oldest or newest elements."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"build","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A custom closure that yields values to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"text":". This closure receives an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream.Continuation"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance that it uses to provide elements to the stream and terminate the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream when finished.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream.Continuation"},{"type":"text","text":" received by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"build"},{"type":"text","text":" closure is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appropriate for use in concurrent contexts. It is thread safe to send and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finish; all calls to the continuation are serialized. However, calling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this from multiple concurrent contexts could result in out-of-order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivery."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows an "},{"code":"AsyncStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" created with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"initializer that produces 100 random numbers on a one-second interval,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calling "},{"code":"yield(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to deliver each element to the awaiting call point.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When the ","type":"text"},{"code":"for","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" loop exits, the stream finishes by calling the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continuation’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let stream = AsyncStream<Int>(Int.self,","                              bufferingPolicy: .bufferingNewest(5)) { continuation in","    Task.detached {","        for _ in 0..<100 {","            await Task.sleep(1 * 1_000_000_000)","            continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...10))","        }","        continuation.finish()","    }","}","","\/\/ Call point:","for await random in stream {","    print(random)","}"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/asyncstream\/init(_:bufferingpolicy:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Constructs an asynchronous stream for an element type, using the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified buffering policy and element-producing closure.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Creating a Continuation-Based Stream","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/Continuation\/BufferingPolicy","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/Continuation"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Creating-a-Continuation-Based-Stream"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncStream\/init(_:bufferingPolicy:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer","modules":[{"name":"Swift","relatedModules":[]}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":fal